{"id":"c18e2a4a9af5e4cb","group":"16","path":"16/16-thm-sets-embedding-eff.md","title":"集合在 Eff 中的反射嵌入","display":"thm-sets-embedding-eff — 集合在 Eff 中的反射嵌入","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory","book_abbrev":"16","label":"16-thm-sets-embedding-eff","aliases":["16-thm-sets-embedding-eff","16-sets-embedding-eff"],"display":"thm-sets-embedding-eff — 集合在 Eff 中的反射嵌入","depends_on":["[[16-df-effective-global-sections]]","[[16-df-functor]]","[[16-df-adjoint-functors]]"],"source":"Proposition 6.2.2, pp. 385–386 (PDF 405–406)","revision_date":"2026-10-20"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"16"},{"key":"label","html":"16-thm-sets-embedding-eff"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>16-thm-sets-embedding-eff</span><span>16-sets-embedding-eff</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-sets-embedding-eff — 集合在 Eff 中的反射嵌入"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"8ffba7376827cc25\" href=\"?note=8ffba7376827cc25\" title=\"16-df-effective-global-sections\">16-df-effective-global-sections</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"fc49efccd7348d66\" href=\"?note=fc49efccd7348d66\" title=\"16-df-functor\">16-df-functor</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"a88937ea87ff8530\" href=\"?note=a88937ea87ff8530\" title=\"16-df-adjoint-functors\">16-df-adjoint-functors</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"Proposition 6.2.2, pp. 385–386 (PDF 405–406)"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-20"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma:\\mathbf{Eff}\\to\\mathbf{Set}\">\\(\\Gamma:\\mathbf{Eff}\\to\\mathbf{Set}\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"8ffba7376827cc25\" href=\"?note=8ffba7376827cc25\" title=\"16-df-effective-global-sections\">16-df-effective-global-sections</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,Y\">\\(X,Y\\)</span> 为小集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:X\\to Y\">\\(f:X\\to Y\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\nabla,\\rho_X,R_f\">\\(\\nabla,\\rho_X,R_f\\)</span> 在下节定义，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[R_f]\">\\([R_f]\\)</span> 为功能关系的逻辑等价类。集合范畴的完整箭头为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle X,Y,f\\rangle\">\\(\\langle X,Y,f\\rangle\\)</span>，Eff箭头为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle\\nabla X,\\nabla Y,[R_f]\\rangle\">\\(\\langle\\nabla X,\\nabla Y,[R_f]\\rangle\\)</span>；固定Hom中仍可简写为图关系类。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Functor}\">\\(\\mathrm{Functor}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\dashv\">\\(\\dashv\\)</span> 分别采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"fc49efccd7348d66\" href=\"?note=fc49efccd7348d66\" title=\"16-df-functor\">16-df-functor</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"a88937ea87ff8530\" href=\"?note=a88937ea87ff8530\" title=\"16-df-adjoint-functors\">16-df-adjoint-functors</a>；下文 Hom 映射作用于带源靶标签的完整箭头。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{Set}\">\\(\\mathbf{Set}\\)</span> 是与 Eff 共同基底的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U}\">\\(\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U}\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\rho_X(x,x^{\\prime})&amp;\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}\\mathbb N&amp;x=x^{\\prime},\\\\\\varnothing&amp;x\\ne x^{\\prime},\\end{cases}\n&amp;\\nabla_0X&amp;\\coloneqq(X,\\rho_X),\\\\\nR_f(x,y)&amp;\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}\\mathbb N&amp;f(x)=y,\\\\\\varnothing&amp;f(x)\\ne y,\\end{cases}\n&amp;\\nabla_1\\langle X,Y,f\\rangle&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle\\nabla_0X,\\nabla_0Y,[R_f]\\rangle,\\\\\n\\nabla&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle\\nabla_0,\\nabla_1\\rangle.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\rho_X(x,x^{\\prime})&amp;\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}\\mathbb N&amp;x=x^{\\prime},\\\\\\varnothing&amp;x\\ne x^{\\prime},\\end{cases}\n&amp;\\nabla_0X&amp;\\coloneqq(X,\\rho_X),\\\\\nR_f(x,y)&amp;\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}\\mathbb N&amp;f(x)=y,\\\\\\varnothing&amp;f(x)\\ne y,\\end{cases}\n&amp;\\nabla_1\\langle X,Y,f\\rangle&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle\\nabla_0X,\\nabla_0Y,[R_f]\\rangle,\\\\\n\\nabla&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle\\nabla_0,\\nabla_1\\rangle.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{gathered}\n\\mathrm{Functor}(\\nabla,\\mathbf{Set},\\mathbf{Eff}),\\qquad\\Gamma\\dashv\\nabla,\\\\\n\\nabla_{X,Y}\\coloneqq\\{\\langle a,\\nabla_1(a)\\rangle\\mid a\\in\\mathbf{Set}(X,Y)\\},\\\\\n\\nabla_{X,Y}:\\mathbf{Set}(X,Y)\\xrightarrow{\\sim}\\mathbf{Eff}(\\nabla_0X,\\nabla_0Y).\n\\end{gathered}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{gathered}\n\\mathrm{Functor}(\\nabla,\\mathbf{Set},\\mathbf{Eff}),\\qquad\\Gamma\\dashv\\nabla,\\\\\n\\nabla_{X,Y}\\coloneqq\\{\\langle a,\\nabla_1(a)\\rangle\\mid a\\in\\mathbf{Set}(X,Y)\\},\\\\\n\\nabla_{X,Y}:\\mathbf{Set}(X,Y)\\xrightarrow{\\sim}\\mathbf{Eff}(\\nabla_0X,\\nabla_0Y).\n\\end{gathered}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>证明：函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:\\Gamma(I,\\rho)\\to X\">\\(f:\\Gamma(I,\\rho)\\to X\\)</span> 对应 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F_f(i,x)=E(i)\">\\(F_f(i,x)=E(i)\\)</span> 若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E(i)\\ne\\varnothing\">\\(E(i)\\ne\\varnothing\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f([i])=x\">\\(f([i])=x\\)</span>，否则为空。该关系满足四项箭头条件。</li>\n<li>反向由箭头关系的全定义、单值性取得唯一的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span>，外延性使它只依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[i]\">\\([i]\\)</span>。两构造互逆且自然，故给出伴随。</li>\n<li>余单位 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\nabla X\\to X\">\\(\\Gamma\\nabla X\\to X\\)</span> 将单元素等价类送回元素，是同构，故 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\nabla\">\\(\\nabla\\)</span> 满忠实。</li>\n<li>来源：Jacobs, <em>Categorical Logic and Type Theory</em>，Proposition 6.2.2, pp. 385–386 (PDF 405–406)。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"16-df-effective-global-sections","status":"resolved","id":"8ffba7376827cc25","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-effective-global-sections]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-functor","status":"resolved","id":"fc49efccd7348d66","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-functor]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-adjoint-functors","status":"resolved","id":"a88937ea87ff8530","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-adjoint-functors]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-effective-global-sections","status":"resolved","id":"8ffba7376827cc25","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Gamma:\\mathbf{Eff}\\to\\mathbf{Set}$ 采用 [[16-df-effective-global-sections]]。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-functor","status":"resolved","id":"fc49efccd7348d66","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Functor}$ 与 $\\dashv$ 分别采用 [[16-df-functor]]、[[16-df-adjoint-functors]]；下文 Hom 映射作用于带源靶标签的完整箭头。$\\mathbf{Set}$ 是与 Eff 共同基底的 $\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U}$。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-adjoint-functors","status":"resolved","id":"a88937ea87ff8530","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Functor}$ 与 $\\dashv$ 分别采用 [[16-df-functor]]、[[16-df-adjoint-functors]]；下文 Hom 映射作用于带源靶标签的完整箭头。$\\mathbf{Set}$ 是与 Eff 共同基底的 $\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U}$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Gamma:\\mathbf{Eff}\\to\\mathbf{Set}","display":false},{"tex":"X,Y","display":false},{"tex":"f:X\\to Y","display":false},{"tex":"\\nabla,\\rho_X,R_f","display":false},{"tex":"[R_f]","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle X,Y,f\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle\\nabla X,\\nabla Y,[R_f]\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Functor}","display":false},{"tex":"\\dashv","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf{Set}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\rho_X(x,x^{\\prime})&\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}\\mathbb N&x=x^{\\prime},\\\\\\varnothing&x\\ne x^{\\prime},\\end{cases}\n&\\nabla_0X&\\coloneqq(X,\\rho_X),\\\\\nR_f(x,y)&\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}\\mathbb N&f(x)=y,\\\\\\varnothing&f(x)\\ne y,\\end{cases}\n&\\nabla_1\\langle X,Y,f\\rangle&\\coloneqq\\langle\\nabla_0X,\\nabla_0Y,[R_f]\\rangle,\\\\\n\\nabla&\\coloneqq\\langle\\nabla_0,\\nabla_1\\rangle.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{gathered}\n\\mathrm{Functor}(\\nabla,\\mathbf{Set},\\mathbf{Eff}),\\qquad\\Gamma\\dashv\\nabla,\\\\\n\\nabla_{X,Y}\\coloneqq\\{\\langle a,\\nabla_1(a)\\rangle\\mid a\\in\\mathbf{Set}(X,Y)\\},\\\\\n\\nabla_{X,Y}:\\mathbf{Set}(X,Y)\\xrightarrow{\\sim}\\mathbf{Eff}(\\nabla_0X,\\nabla_0Y).\n\\end{gathered}","display":true},{"tex":"f:\\Gamma(I,\\rho)\\to X","display":false},{"tex":"F_f(i,x)=E(i)","display":false},{"tex":"E(i)\\ne\\varnothing","display":false},{"tex":"f([i])=x","display":false},{"tex":"x","display":false},{"tex":"[i]","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma\\nabla X\\to X","display":false},{"tex":"\\nabla","display":false}],"bytes":2344,"backlinks":[{"id":"1bdcb9b14f83cac1","anchor":"ref-451","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[16-thm-sets-embedding-eff|thm-sets-embedding-eff — 集合在 Eff 中的反射嵌入]]"},{"id":"512abfcc793a6632","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$j_{\\neg\\neg}=\\neg_\\Omega\\neg_\\Omega$ 是 [[16-df-nucleus]] 构造的双重否定nucleus；$\\omega\\mathbf{Sets}$ 与 $\\mathbf{Set}$ 的嵌入取 [[16-thm-omega-sets-embedding-eff]]、[[16-thm-sets-embedding-eff]]。"},{"id":"a89d8b916a65815e","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\nabla:\\mathbf{Set}\\to\\mathbf{Eff}$ 与 $\\Gamma:\\mathbf{Eff}\\to\\mathbf{Set}$ 取 [[16-thm-sets-embedding-eff]] 同一显式构造；$X,Y$ 为任意小集合。"}],"outgoing":["8ffba7376827cc25","fc49efccd7348d66","a88937ea87ff8530"]}